OL,3,GNEWSAEight-year scaffolding battle
OL,4,Acould soon be over
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn eight-year battle to get scaffolding
OL,7,Fremoved from a pavement could soon be
OL,8,Fover.
OL,10,FThe temporary structure has been
OL,11,Fsupporting the remains of a factory in
OL,12,Fthe High Street in Aylesbury,
OL,13,FBuckinghamshire.
OL,15,FGiles du Boulay, who lives nearby, said
OL,16,Fthe scaffolding was an "accident
OL,17,Fwaiting to happen".
OL,19,FBuckinghamshire Council said the
OL,20,Ffootpath could be reopened as soon as a
OL,21,Fdesign for the work was approved.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
